        "text": "**Defining the Messaging Provider**\n\nI've decided to proceed with Google Cloud Pub/Sub as the external messaging service. The Python code will be written to explicitly use this provider. Now, the code will focus on connecting, sending, and handling messages with this specific Pub/Sub implementation.\n\n\n**Implementing the Publisher**\n\nI'm now fully committed to Google Cloud Pub/Sub for the messaging implementation. The focus is on the `publish_event.py` script. I'm building out the code, tackling the import of the Pub/Sub library, and crafting the necessary definitions for project and topic IDs. My current task is generating the `PublisherClient` and structuring how I'll publish a JSON message. Error handling will be included.\n\n\n",
